{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55583","headline":"入古寺作（题拟） · 措多","name":"入古寺作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此寺何年造，问僧僧不知。\n系马枯松下，拂尘读古碑。\n（《祖堂集》卷十一。\n）（按：《祖堂集》引灵照语云：「措多入古寺，问僧：『此寺名什摩？\n』其僧不知名额，措多遂作一诗曰〖诗略〗。\n」疑措多即措大，非人名。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"措多","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}